 "title": "Tachycardia decision chart: cardiovert if unstable, then sort by QRS width; narrow complex tachycardia is split by blocking the AV node (continues: atrial tachycardias; stops: AVNRT or AVRT), wide complex tachycardia by adenosine (slows or stops: SVT with aberrancy; no effect: monomorphic or polymorphic VT), each with its ECG and acute then long-term treatment",
